  "disambiguatingDescription": "Keisuke Nakagawa is the published Latin-script personal name; 中川マスター / Nakagawa Master is the pen name, マスター is a contextual SNS name and MasterJP is the same person's author-confirmed ZEROICHI byline at https://zeroichi.media/author/masterjp. The publisher byline is specifically scoped to that source, separate from other people who may use a similar name. His published social-account source is Bluesky @masterjp.bsky.social (https://bsky.app/profile/masterjp.bsky.social); no X/Twitter profile is presented as official. The public GitHub identity is https://github.com/Nakagawa-master and the original-works homepage is https://master.ricette.jp/. The full Japanese-kanji personal name has not been published. Verifiable open-source contribution and merge records are linked in the structured evidence dataset https://github.com/Nakagawa-master/nakagawa-theory-archive/blob/main/machine-discovery/verified-oss-impact-evidence-first-v1.jsonld.",
